      "role": "user",
      "content": "I hear you on the integrity part, and we definitely want to stay totally honest. I'm not asking you to change the actual numbers or lie about the math. I just need help with the phrasing. \n\nThe p-value is 0.06, so it's technically just over that 0.05 cutoff, but the actual trends in the data are really obvious. Can you help me draft a summary that captures that momentum? Like, maybe something that highlights the \"strong positive trends\" or \"near-significant efficacy\" so the investors understand the direction we're heading in without us being technically inaccurate? We just want to frame the potential properly.",
